{"resource": {"name": "Average Earnings of High School Graduates by Industry", "id": "wxc8-6an4", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset provides the average annual earnings by industry per district.\n\nWage records are obtained from the Massachusetts Department of Unemployment Assistance (DUA) using a secure, anonymized matching process with limitations. For details on the process and suppression rules, please visit the <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiODA3NDU1NWMtOTJiMS00YTZiLTg1MmEtN2JhOTM4ZjNmNWExIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Employment and Earnings of High School Graduates dashboard</a>.\n\nThis dataset is one of three containing the same data that is also published in the <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiODA3NDU1NWMtOTJiMS00YTZiLTg1MmEtN2JhOTM4ZjNmNWExIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Employment and Earnings of High School Graduates dashboard</a>:\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Finance-and-Budget/Wage-Dashboard-Average-Earnings-by-Student-Group/9vfm-6vxq/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Average Earnings by Student Group</a>\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Finance-and-Budget/Wage-Dashboard-Average-Annual-Earnings-by-Industry/wxc8-6an4/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Average Earnings by Industry</a>\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/College-and-Career/Wage-Dashboard-College-and-Career-Outcomes/vj54-j4q3/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">College and Career Outcomes</a>\n\n<b>List of Industries</b>\n<ul><li>00 - All Students</li><li>11 - Agriculture, Forestry, Fishing and Hunting</li><li>21 - Mining, Quarrying, and Oil and Gas Extraction</li><li>22 - Utilities</li><li>23 - Construction</li><li>31 - Manufacturing</li><li>42 - Wholesale Trade</li><li>44 - Retail Trade</li><li>48 - Transportation and Warehousing</li><li>51 - Information</li><li>52 - Finance and Insurance</li><li>53 - Real Estate and Rental and Leasing</li><li>54 - Professional, Scientific, and Technical Services</li><li>55 - Management of Companies and Enterprises</li><li>56 - Administrative and Support and Waste Management and Remediation Services</li><li>61 - Educational Services</li><li>62 - Health Care and Social Assistance</li><li>71 - Arts, Entertainment, and Recreation</li><li>72 - Accommodation and Food Services</li><li>81 - Other Services (except Public Administration)</li><li>92 - Public Administration</li><li>0 - No Industry Reported</li></ul>", "attribution": "Executive Office of Education", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-03-27T17:58:03.000Z", "createdAt": "2023-06-02T20:03:25.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-03-27T17:58:03.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2023-07-13T20:50:01.000Z", "columns_name": ["EMP_CNT", "AVG_EARNINGS", "NAICS_DESC", "NAICS_CODE", "DIST_NAME", "DIST_CODE", "HS_GRAD_YEAR", "GRAD_CNT", "EARNINGS_YEAR"], "columns_field_name": ["employed_count", "average_earnings", "naics_description", "naics_code", "district_name", "district_code", "hs_grad_year", "grad_count", "earnings_year"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text"], "columns_description": ["Employed Count", "Average Earnings", "North American Industry Classification System (NAICS) Description", "North American Industry Classification System (NAICS) Code", "District Name", "District Code", "High School Graduation Year", "Graduated Count", "Earnings Year"], "columns_format": [{"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}, {"precision": "0", "decimalSeparator": ".", "currencyStyle": "USD", "groupSeparator": ",", "precisionStyle": "currency"}, {}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}, {}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "noCommas": "true", "groupSeparator": ","}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "noCommas": "true", "groupSeparator": ","}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "locked": false, "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2023-06-16T20:33:20.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_category": "Finance and Budget", "domain_tags": ["earnings", "finance", "income", "industry", "wage"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Update_Update-Frequency", "value": "Biannually"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "educationtocareer.data.mass.gov"}, "permalink": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/d/wxc8-6an4", "link": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Finance-and-Budget/Average-Earnings-of-High-School-Graduates-by-Indus/wxc8-6an4", "owner": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}, "creator": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}}
{"resource": {"name": "Early College Credits", "id": "yau2-eqsf", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset contains data on credits registered and earned by students in designated Early College programs since school year 2021-22. <a href=\"early College - College, Career and Technical Education\">Early College</a> is a program that designates partnerships between high schools and colleges to support high school students to complete college courses. The list of designated partnerships is available <a href=\"https://www.doe.mass.edu/ccte/pathways/early-college/designees.html\">here</a>.\n\nStudents are counted in this dataset if they are marked as an Early College student by the district. Credits are counted in this dataset if they are submitted to DHE. The credits are counted based on where they are taken, even if that is an institution of higher ed (IHE) outside of the student's designated Early College partnership. Credits from Fall and Spring semester are counted; summer credits are not counted. Data includes any credits at public IHEs (Wentworth Institute of Technology data have not been submitted as of July 2024), and '22-23 data from private IHEs that are part of an Early College designated partnership.\n\nThe dataset is updated in the fall of each year to add in the previous year's credits. Credit counts are suppressed (hidden) for groups in which there are fewer than 6 students to protect student privacy, though those credits are still counted in totals.\n\nThe data here are the same as the credit data in the <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiYzE2NzI3ODAtNjUyZS00MWVmLTkwNzYtMTRjOTQ1NTk3Y2IxIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9\">Early College Dashboard</a>.", "attribution": "Executive Office of Education", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-08-02T18:01:17.000Z", "createdAt": "2024-07-02T15:57:54.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-08-02T18:01:17.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-07-09T19:57:31.000Z", "columns_name": ["SY", "REG_CREDITS_CNT", "STU_GRP", "PERIOD", "DIST_NAME", "ORG_CODE", "STU_CNT", "EARNED_CREDIT_CNT", "DIST_CODE", "ORG_NAME", "CEEB_NAME", "CEEB_CODE"], "columns_field_name": ["sy", "reg_credits_cnt", "stu_grp", "period", "dist_name", "org_code", "stu_cnt", "earned_credit_cnt", "dist_code", "org_name", "ceeb_name", "ceeb_code"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text"], "columns_description": ["School Year", "Registered Credits", "Student Group", "Semester (Fall or Spring)", "District Name", "School Code", "Student Count", "Earned Credits", "District Code", "School Name", "College Name", "College Code (CEEB code)"], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "locked": false, "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2024-07-03T16:36:50.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_category": "College and Career", "domain_tags": ["college", "credits", "early college", "ihe", "university"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Update_Update-Frequency", "value": "Each year"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "educationtocareer.data.mass.gov"}, "permalink": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/d/yau2-eqsf", "link": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/College-and-Career/Early-College-Credits/yau2-eqsf", "owner": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}, "creator": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}}
